xinghai-q01.content:
- **Grand Narrative**: From a low-level scavenger welding scrap in the slums, to step-by-step collecting intermediate, advanced, and ultimately pinnacle mechanic knowledge embargoed by the three Universal Civilizations.
- **Core Milestones**:
  1. Master and thoroughly absorb Advanced Applied Energy Dynamics (S05) and Micro Exoskeleton Power Core Assembly Blueprint (I41) to build your very first personal combat exoskeleton;
  2. Tap into the Black Star Mercenary Group's armaments assembly line, acquiring Heavy Personal Rail Sniper Rifle Fabrication (S08) and heavy assault ship skeletal framing blueprints;
  3. Awaken the ancient warship-graveyard AI Risda (P22) to crack the main battle-brain control array of a lost civilization;
  4. Ultimately erect an autonomous mechanical army fully under your command within the seams of the three Universal Civilizations.

xinghai-q02.content:
- **Grand Narrative**: Save a tragic species marching toward extinction under the cold, indifferent gaze of the cosmos.
- **Core Milestones**:
  1. Survive on the frontline defense, earning the broken-blade trust of Clan Chief Relmont (P24);
  2. Help Melos (P18) untangle his inner trauma and reforge his ship-slicing blade, allowing him to take up the weapon once more to defend his homeworld;
  3. Trace the clues to intercept the mutation source inducer code black box (I57) used by DarkStar to engineer the Mutation Disaster, forcing the Godoran Academy of Sciences to surrender the complete genetic purification formula;
  4. Lead Sunil warriors out of the mire, carving out an independent autonomous domain in the Shattered Star Ring free from enslavement by anyone.

xinghai-q03.content:
- **Grand Narrative**: Forge an elite armed faction that sends shockwaves through the star cluster amid the neutral sanctuary of Floating Dragon, regional financial syndicates, and the rising tide of Black Star.
- **Core Milestones**:
  1. Verify actual professional registration and the condition of an owned, deployed, working frigate;
  2. Secure a Mercenary Alliance-certified B-rank independent license, carving out exclusive escort corridors across the Silver-Green Route;
  3. Disengage unscathed from border skirmishes between Godora and DarkStar, engraving your name upon high-bounty contract rosters throughout the cosmos;
  4. Claim a personal seat on Floating Dragon Island, standing shoulder-to-shoulder with Beyond Grade A titans to divide interstellar interests.
